    rdfs:label "Dubrulle & Pourquié (2001, 2004) FGF8 mRNA decay wavefront and determination front positioning in vertebrate somitogenesis (Gallus gallus (chick embryo presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites))",
        "Dubrulle & Pourquié (2001, 2004) FGF8 mRNA decay wavefront and determination front positioning in vertebrate somitogenesis faithfully reproduces Gallus gallus (chick embryo presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites) morphology" ;
