    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Gallus gallus (chick embryo presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 59.0/100, audit 2026-10-19-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py> ;
