<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Dubrulle & Pourquié (2001, 2004) FGF8 mRNA decay wavefront and determination front positioning in vertebrate somitogenesis — MorphoEval overall 59.0/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 baseline assessment of `2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py` (59.3/100). The initial baseline captures the steady exponential fgf8 mRNA profile m(x) = m_0 exp(-k_d x / v_g) and wild-type somite length S_0 = v_g * T_c = 150 um, but requires full upwind characteristic PDE integration verification against the analytical steady state, explicit modeling of the compensatory anterior-small + posterior-large somite pair around an ectopic FGF8 bead alongside SU5402 FGFR1 inhibition and a k_d = 0 no-decay negative control, and bilateral dorsal somite segmentation against the vendored avian/vertebrate SEM specimen (`chick_somite_psm_specimen.jpg`). Overall 59.0/100 (faithfulness 57.1, reproducibility 63.5); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 63, Morphological realism / specimen match 53, Parameter expressivity 59, Morphometric validation 55, Source and data traceability 66, Code-to-model traceability 61, Reproducibility package 63. Output judged: docs/media/fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis_comparison.png: rendered output of 2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 1318157 B, 2352×1372 px, artifact_sha256 56ac2304ddaf5a5712326eb19bafbe9c34cd7bc819580c44dcae1df7d5088234 (sha256 56ac2304ddaf5a5712326eb19bafbe9c34cd7bc819580c44dcae1df7d5088234), spec_fingerprint 5358f6fac89be6e91719f6dec1d96fe25095ac5d5f268b2b982c2f173b109336. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 5358f6fac89be6e91719f6dec1d96fe25095ac5d5f268b2b982c2f173b109336; artifact_sha256: 56ac2304ddaf5a5712326eb19bafbe9c34cd7bc819580c44dcae1df7d5088234; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis/chick_somite_psm_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2..., datasets/fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis/fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis_reference.json=93e00c49c65550f9..., datasets/fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis/scout_manifest.json=a38a686592f1ffd0...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add bilateral dorsal somite row DoG peak & inter-somitic cleft segmentation on `datasets/fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis/chick_somite_psm_specimen.jpg` with phase-aligned Pearson r correlation.",
        "remediation needed: Include all 5 Dubrulle et al. (2001, 2004) experimental regimes (wild-type, FGF8 bead anterior compression, FGF8 bead posterior catch-up, SU5402 FGFR1 inhibition, and pCAGGS-FGF8 electroporation) plus a k_d = 0 no-decay negative control.",
        "remediation needed: Verify characteristic-upwind advection-decay PDE convergence against m_0 exp(-k_d x / v_g) (L2 relative error < 0.001) and enforce the two-cycle ectopic FGF8 bead somite conservation identity S_ant + S_post = 2*S_0 = 300 um." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Dubrulle & Pourquié (2001, 2004) FGF8 mRNA decay wavefront and determination front positioning in vertebrate somitogenesis — Parameter expressivity: 59/100" ;
